      <activity id="5bf5b072-4613-5c29-9b5b-92697cb831a0" activityNameId="4e0071de-c84d-5240-864c-365a6cf09570" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Solar system, flat plate collector, multiple dwelling, hot water</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Solar system, flat plate collector, multiple dwelling, hot water
Solar system with a flat plate collector on a multiple family dwelling for hot water;
UUID: c0068721-2881-3ea2-af66-8bbb21dd2e8e
Production and disposal of a complete solar system (excluding auxiliary heating). Including different components, heat exchange fluid, installation copper pipes, transports of parts to CH, delivery with a van and montage on the roof.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Solar collector system for hot water installed on the roof of a house.
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: 185 systems were sold in CH in 2001
Sampling: Own simulation. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c0068721-2881-3ea2-af66-8bbb21dd2e8e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
